Prudent Practices in the Laboratory — National Research Council (@gc-prudent: 0, is #reference, #part-of @gc-sources) { r_3RPEFRP5NBW53ECS7EFQX6D6ZK
National Research Council, Committee on Prudent Practices in the Laboratory. Prudent Practices in the Laboratory: Handling and Management of Chemical Hazards, Updated Version. National Academies Press, 2011. DOI 10.17226/12654. [Official publication, free reading/PDF access, and corrections](https://www.nationalacademies.org/projects/BCST-L-05-06-A/publication/12654) · [Read online](https://www.nationalacademies.org/read/12654).

Read the complete book during sustained laboratory preparation, concentrating first on planning, hazards, management, operations, waste, and emergency arrangements. Examine the publisher's linked corrections as well as the original text; the publication page identifies a 2015 correction to chemical-storage compatibility information in associated material.

The publisher offers free reading and a PDF through its stated guest/login procedure. Copyright and component notices remain applicable; no unrestricted reuse licence is assumed. It is a technical reference, not a substitute for current law or an actual laboratory's procedures. Edition, authorship, access route, scope, and correction notice checked on 29 October 2026. No publication or associated media are copied into the repository.

